Squashed linux-surface/libwacom branch ipts: BUS_VIRTUAL and Intel ME bus
matching in the library (parser, kernel-device mapping, match printer,
debug tool) plus the Microsoft Surface tablet definitions and the test
updates that keep %check green. Stock libwacom rejects these DeviceMatch
entries and never maps BUS_VIRTUAL devices, so data files alone cannot
work -- see the note in bluespin's build_files/build.sh.

Generated from linux-surface/libwacom @ ipts (87f8269e, 2025-12-30):
  git diff libwacom-2.17.0-9-gb33bb7b4..ipts
Applies cleanly onto the libwacom-2.19.0 release; regenerate from the
ipts branch when it moves.

